{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Legendary Feat\n\nPrerequisites: Constitution 15 or higher\n\nSurviving long battles at your limit have granted you an unbreakable will.\n\n- Your Constitution score increases by 1, up to a maximum of 20.\n\n- After receiving damage in a single battle, equal to half of your maximum Hit Points, you can gain the effects of Haste as a reaction until you finish the combat. After the effect ends you receive 2 exhaustion levels and are unable to use this feature until you finish a short or long rest.\n\n- Additionally, once per turn when you drop to 0 HP and don\u0027t die outright you can spend a single hit dice to instantly recover 1 HP and remain standing.","level":1}],"id":"Custom13253d38-156b-457b-994a-2b6e13b577a0","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Berseker Soul [SM] [Revised]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}